      "example_text": "Input: nums = [3,4,5,1,2]\nOutput: true\nExplanation: [1,2,3,4,5] is the original sorted array.\nYou can rotate the array by x = 3 positions to begin on the element of value 3: [3,4,5,1,2].",
      "images": []
    },
    {
      "example_num": 2,
